@PAD: aep-live-entry-registration-v1
@GCDE: gaplune.policy.v1
schema_id: gaplune.aep.component-registration.v1
format: gaplune
json_prohibited: true
id: aep-live-entry
version: 0.1.0
kind: library
path: AEP-Components/live-entry/
ticket: AEP28-ENV-036
requires: aep-envelope aep-no-sequential-ts-deny
capability: admit.live-entry.rust
note: Product live path is Rust with in-process aep_envelope admit, and a template target_id is not a skip so every opened frame still runs collect-all Admit then Apply. freeze_temporal_snapshot keeps bridge time at seal so a 1000 ms hold still meets 50 ms drift.
